OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy rain and strong winds
OL,6,Fquickly will sweep in through Sunday
OL,7,Fmorning across the region Coastal
OL,8,Fgales are likely to develop at times.
OL,9,FA mild day despite the rain and wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain and wind will quickly
OL,12,Fclear and ease away this evening to
OL,13,Fleave a dry and chilly night with
OL,14,Fclear spells and a rural grass frost.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FLargely dry on Monday with
OL,17,Flight winds and long sunny spells.
OL,18,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine. A
OL,19,Fsmall chance of the odd shower at
OL,20,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
